# Recorded Playwright reports are evidence, not source.
#
# These are compared byte-for-byte and hashed to prove a run is the run it
# claims to be, so git must not rewrite their line endings on checkout. Without
# this, `core.autocrlf` on a Windows clone hands back a file that differs from
# the one that was committed -- harmless to JSON.parse, fatal to "is this the
# artefact I recorded?".
runs/*.json -text
